    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78021" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-θλίβω</span></b>  [i], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>press at the side</i>, 
